0..78 Comment "// A model passed to an implicit (#739): a function quantifies over a model in"
79..151 Comment "// its prefix block, `[s : Model(Tally)]`, which binds one parameter per"
152..230 Comment "// component of `Tally`, and reads each as `s.x`. A call supplies a module for"
231..310 Comment "// it by name, `stepped[.s = Up](4)`, passing the module\'s members; a module of"
311..389 Comment "// a theory that includes `Tally` passes its reduct, and a function passes its"
390..470 Comment "// own model implicit on, `stepped[.s = t]`. A manifest model type fixes a sort,"
471..499 Comment "// which binds no parameter."
